            "notes": "[Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) is one of the main ways you buff people in this build. As you heal your team, you'll be constantly giving them passive buffs through this and an item you'll pick up later. Sometimes though, it can be useful to take [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) in the first round, but I only really tend to if the enemy team has multiple things you need to cleanse, like two of [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000), [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317) (discord orb!) and [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54). \n\nYou CAN run the build without [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198), and at that point it's an AP kitsune rush focused build, but I find the buffs the fun part and tend to only not use them when I have an [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) not using an overheat build.\n\n### TO NOTE:\nif an item is marked IMPORTANT, you don't want to remove it unless specifically stated within the round notes. Otherwise, other items can be swapped in or out with items under optional depending on how much cash you have.",
