            "notes": "You can swap [Talisman of Velocity](item_9b81fbe9-c5f8-4442-93d5-082b036010a1) for [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) here if you want, or take out [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) and other blue/green items to take both Talisman items.\n\nIf your team is rolling, then [Talisman of Velocity](item_9b81fbe9-c5f8-4442-93d5-082b036010a1) can make everything go ever quicker, but also, other builds can power spike more than you'd expect, so you might want to have the extra safety that [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) gets you first.",
